inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">② この宿を選ぶべき人</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">「宿坊に泊まりたいけれど天然温泉の露天風呂にも入りたい」「昭和の名作庭家・重森三玲氏が手掛けた三庭園を鑑賞したい」という人。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">③ この宿で得られる体験</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">毎朝の護摩祈祷による厄除け。季節の野菜を使った伝統の精進料理会席（クチコミ⭐3.96）。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「高野山の聖地で天然温泉と圧巻の日本庭園を一度に楽しむなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F8108%2F8108.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】高野山温泉　福智院 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">3. 善光寺宿坊 淵之坊（長野県長野市元善町・善光寺境内）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-am